update construction has no IO
async update intersects predicates and snapshots setters
reused update and zero hits stay fail closed
repeated update does not accumulate key bindings
delete construction has no IO
async delete intersects predicates and rereads candidates
composite keys retain bound SQL guard across await
composite text and integer delete keys stay parameterized
sync terminals retain predicate behavior
raw SQL OR cannot bypass update predicate
raw SQL OR cannot bypass delete predicate
